      "text": "Z    Symbol  Name          Config (abbreviated)    Common ox.  Ionic radius (pm, +3)\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  57   La      Lanthanum     [Xe] 5d¹ 6s²           +3          103.2\n  58   Ce      Cerium        [Xe] 4f¹ 5d¹ 6s²       +4, +3      101.0\n  59   Pr      Praseodymium  [Xe] 4f³ 6s²           +3          99.0\n  60   Nd      Neodymium     [Xe] 4f⁴ 6s²           +3          98.3\n  61   Pm      Promethium    [Xe] 4f⁵ 6s²           +3          97.0 *\n  62   Sm      Samarium      [Xe] 4f⁶ 6s²           +3, +2      95.8\n  63   Eu      Europium      [Xe] 4f⁷ 6s²           +3, +2      94.7\n  64   Gd      Gadolinium    [Xe] 4f⁷ 5d¹ 6s²       +3          93.8\n  65   Tb      Terbium       [Xe] 4f⁹ 6s²           +3, +4      92.3\n  66   Dy      Dysprosium    [Xe] 4f¹⁰ 6s²          +3          91.2\n  67   Ho      Holmium       [Xe] 4f¹¹ 6s²          +3          90.1\n  68   Er      Erbium        [Xe] 4f¹² 6s²          +3          89.0\n  69   Tm      Thulium       [Xe] 4f¹³ 6s²          +3          88.0\n  70   Yb      Ytterbium     [Xe] 4f¹⁴ 6s²          +3, +2      86.8\n  71   Lu      Lutetium      [Xe] 4f¹⁴ 5d¹ 6s²     +3          86.1"
    },
